<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44417" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐμαθ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαθεῖν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ready</i> or <i>quick at learning</i>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσμαθής</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				486c
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				344a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					24.17
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			). Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῶς, παρακολουθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.116
				</span></i>
			: 
				Comp.
			 -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έστερον</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				723a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>easy to learn</i> or <i>know, intelligible</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				442
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1409b4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. φώνημα</span>
			<i>well-known</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔγνωστα καὶ εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				20.14
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				614
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διήγησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					14.12.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
